// Partition/Sort/StableSort/PartialSort/NthElement/the heap niebloids
// delegate to classic std::partition/sort/stable_sort/... and heap ops,
// which live in <__bits/algorithm_classic> (the classic-algorithms leaf,
// safe to include from anywhere -- see ranges_algo_mut's identical note). No
// longer relying on <algorithm>'s fixed include order to see any of this.
